    <bf:title>
      <bf:Title>
	<bf:mainTitle>The most dangerous games</bf:mainTitle>
	<bflc:nonSortNum>4</bflc:nonSortNum>
      </bf:Title>
    </bf:title>
    <bf:content>
      <bf:Content rdf:about="http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/contentTypes/txt">
	<rdfs:label>text</rdfs:label>
	<bf:code>txt</bf:code>
      </bf:Content>
    </bf:content>
    <bf:summary>
      <bf:Summary>
	<rdfs:label>"THE BOOK EVENT OF THE YEAR: An unprecedented blockbuster collaboration between MrBeast, the world's #1 creator with more than a billion followers, and James Patterson, the world's #1 bestselling author. In a world on the brink of collapse, one hundred players face off in a ruthless, high-stakes competition with everything on the line. The reward? The chance to save humanity - and one billion dollars. The stakes couldn't be higher. Across brutal environments and relentless challenges, players are pushed beyond every limit as the stakes escalate - and survival becomes the only rule. Fast-paced, cinematic, and impossible to put down, The Most Dangerous Games is a global thriller event where spectacle meets suspense - and the world is watching. The Highest Stakes: Enter a thrilling, high-stakes survival competition where contestants compete for a one-billion dollar prize and the chance to save humanity Nothing Can Prepare You: You've seen Beast Games, but now the games are more dangerous than ever, pushing players to their limits in a fight for survival across treacherous landscapes You've seen MrBeast break the internet. But nothing could prepare you for a competition this wild"-- Provided by publisher.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Summary>
    </bf:summary>
